{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26028","headline":"归鴈 · 鲍溶","name":"归鴈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国春早煖，渚蒲正月生。\n东风吹鴈心，上下和乐声。\n绕水半空去，拂云偕相迎。\n如防失羣怨，预有侵夜惊。\n渺邈天外影，支离塞中莺。\n自顾摧颓羽，偏感南北情。\n乍甘烟雾劳，不顾龙沙荣。\n虽乐未归意，终不能自鸣。\n喜去春月满，归来秋风清。\n啼余碧窗梦，望断阴山行。\n不及瑶𥯅燕，寄身金宫楹","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}